Upstream: https://github.com/envoyproxy/gateway
Version: v1alpha1

The CRDs in this directory are hand-authored stubs sufficient for
envtest-based integration tests of the OEP-0011 traffic translator.
The stubs preserve unknown fields (x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields)
on .spec and .status so the translator's unstructured writes succeed
without modeling the full BTP schema.

Production correctness is NOT validated by these stubs — the real EG
controller does that on a live cluster. The stubs only need to let
envtest accept Create / Update / Get / Patch on the GVK.

To refresh from upstream:

  # On a machine with internet access:
  curl -fsSL \
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/envoyproxy/gateway/v1.X.Y/charts/gateway-helm/crds/generated/gateway.envoyproxy.io_backendtrafficpolicies.yaml \
    > tests/integration/dep-crds/envoy-gateway/backendtrafficpolicies.yaml

If a future EG release breaks the BTP API shape (rare for v1alpha1+),
update the OME translator paths (translators/envoygateway/translator.go)
and refresh the CRD here.
